<p><strong>Seven people or fewer:</strong> an Innova Crysta is the more economical choice. <strong>Eight or nine people:</strong> the 9 seater Tempo Traveller is the right vehicle. <strong>Ten to twelve people:</strong> the 12 seater Maharaja is cheaper per km and gives more room.</p>
<p>A point that surprises many people: the 12 seater Maharaja Tempo Traveller costs less per km than the 9 seater, because of how the tariff is set. If your group is 10 or more, you do not need to compromise. If your group is nine and you want more room, the 12 seater is also worth a quote.</p>

